CLASSIFICATION compiler-semantics-ir-runtime
CLASSIFICATION optimizer-documentation
REQUIRED_CHECK optimizer-admission-quick	optimizer admission / quick	cd Toolchain && zig build check
REQUIRED_CHECK optimizer-qualified-internal	optimizer admission / qualified internal	cd Toolchain && zig build optimizer-gate
REQUIRED_CHECK optimizer-robustness-qualified	optimizer admission / robustness	cd Toolchain && zig build optimizer-robustness-qualified
REQUIRED_CHECK native-portability-matrix	optimizer admission / native portability	run native-portability.yml for every affected target
REQUIRED_CHECK external-qualification-selected	optimizer admission / external qualification	run the Silex-Benchmarks qualification selected by this matrix against the exact Silex SHA
